        },
        {
          "text": " Akiroit a Ekapolon Akuj naga, na alimokinio Sepania lokookeng a Kuchi, alo arai lokookeng a Gedalia, alo arai lokookeng a Amaria, alo arai lokookeng a Esekia. Ngirwa ngulu, Yosia lokookeng a Amon ngesi arai ekapolon a Yuda.",
